00:41:51.990 --> 00:41:53.910
If so, how to establish the connections?

00:41:53.910 --> 00:41:58.400
Perhaps with your you might
have some experience with that.

00:41:58.400 --> 00:42:03.730
&gt;&gt; So it is always a good idea to
first use the published resources.

00:42:03.730 --> 00:42:07.150
And I mentioned the FDA website
with a lot of useful information.

00:42:07.150 --> 00:42:12.080
So, once you've done with a company
the homework and evaluated as good as you

00:42:12.080 --> 00:42:16.890
can the resources, I think it's always
a good idea to reach out to the agency and

00:42:16.890 --> 00:42:17.810
have an early dialogue.

00:42:19.390 --> 00:42:21.940
But you increase
