00:42:41.120 --> 00:42:46.970
aside from the typical regulatory review
branch, context and division context

00:42:46.970 --> 00:42:52.281
is to make use of that free advice
through the center, again it's D-I-C-E

00:42:52.281 --> 00:42:57.500
at the agency and they provide
webinars and also a telephone hotline.

00:42:57.500 --> 00:42:59.360
That might be a good first segue,
especially for

00:42:59.360 --> 00:43:02.060
small companies who experience
this process for the first time.

